+    properties=kafka_properties
+)
+
+env.add_source(cdc_source) \
+    .map(parse_cdc_event) \
+    .filter(lambda e: e['op'] in ['c', 'u', 'd']) \
+    .key_by(lambda e: e['after']['id'] if e['after'] else e['before']['id']) \
+    .process(CDCMergeFunction()) \
+    .add_sink(delta_lake_sink)
+```
